config BR2_PACKAGE_CPU_MODELS
	bool "cpu-models"
	default n
	help
	  The int8 networks majestic's own engine runs on the CPU, in
	  /usr/share/majestic. Each is chosen below. MIT.

	  https://github.com/OpenIPC/cpu-models

if BR2_PACKAGE_CPU_MODELS

config BR2_PACKAGE_CPU_MODELS_PERSON
	bool "person detector"
	default y
	help
	  person.qnet, the person detector majestic's object detection runs
	  on cameras without an NPU, with the thresholds of its three presets
	  beside it in person.json. Only the HiSilicon/Goke parts with the IVE
	  motion backend use it. 84 KB.

config BR2_PACKAGE_CPU_MODELS_DRUM
	bool "meter drum reader"
	default y
	help
	  drum.qnet, which majestic's meter reading reads the drums of a
	  water, gas or electricity meter with, on any camera majestic can
	  hold a frame on (HiSilicon, SigmaStar). 49 KB.

endif
